  "live_records": {
    "q-108262": {
      "dom_id": "step-q108262",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "The table below gives the values of $x$ that satisfy $P(X\\ge x)=p,$ where $X∼{χ}^{2}(k).$  Given that the random variable $X∼{χ}^{2}(5),$ find the value of $x$ such that $P(X\\ge x)=0.995.$\n\n| $k∖p$ | $0.995$ | $0.990$ | $0.975$ | $0.950$ | $0.900$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $3$ | $\\,0.072\\,$ | $\\,0.115\\,$ | $\\,0.216\\,$ | $\\,0.352\\,$ | $\\,0.584\\,$ |\n| $4$ | $\\,0.207\\,$ | $\\,0.297\\,$ | $\\,0.484\\,$ | $\\,0.711\\,$ | $\\,1.064\\,$ |\n| $5$ | $\\,0.412\\,$ | $\\,0.554\\,$ | $\\,0.831\\,$ | $\\,1.145\\,$ | $\\,1.610\\,$ |",
      "worked_solution": "Since $X∼{χ}^{2}(5),$ we focus on the row of the table that corresponds to $k=5.$\n\n| $k∖p$ | $0.995$ | $0.990$ | $0.975$ | $0.950$ | $0.900$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $5$ | $\\,0.412\\,$ | $\\,0.554\\,$ | $\\,0.831\\,$ | $\\,1.145\\,$ | $\\,1.610\\,$ |\n\nFrom this row, we see that\n\n$$\nP(X\\ge 0.412)=0.995.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our answer is $x=0.412.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
